ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810050/extras/e67d163c47301e9accda31a8f4abc889.avif?t=1771579965\" width=616 height=128 /></span><br><br>Fortune Avenue is the outcome of several years' work by a single living being, well, a single human being. Except for the soundtrack, which was composed by an exceptional Montreal music group!<br>We are happy about constructive feedback of all kinds, so feel free to contact us! We will do our best to respond to messages quickly and fix any problems that may arise. :)","developers":["Binogure Studio \ud83d\udc3a"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810050/0dc230549a2a3b33a541064567ea65b18df0557b/header_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1771579965","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Fortune Avenue developed by Binogure Studio \u00a9 2026. Published by Binogure studio. All trademarks, copyrights and logos are property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Kernel 6.5, GLIBC 2.36<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Single Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3 (1280x720)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> St\u00e9r\u00e9o<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Debian &gt; Arch &gt; Windows</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Kernel 6.5, GLIBC 2.36<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:<